  "description": "ASP.NET Core Minimal API helpers built on the native .NET 11 stack (sync + async AddValidation with localized messages, ProblemDetails, request localization): modular endpoints, CQRS-lite operations returning Outcome<T>, JSON-file IStringLocalizer, timezone awareness, correlation id, in-memory/Redis domain event bus, and contract-only Model Context Protocol (MCP) integration that exposes opt-in API contracts to AI agents over Streamable HTTP behind a single API key.",
